{"completed": true, "response": "{\"valid\":true,\"why\":\"解释有具体的历史依据和心理因果。H1已建立他为了珍惜眼下的自在而把话留在心里，S02-B1又呈现亲近而不必说话、沉默也不紧张的状态，因此‘话仍留着，却渐渐敢享受亲近，反而更加轻松’是有根据的延续。S02-B4明确包含因为太喜欢眼前的好而提前舍不得，S02-B2又有时间不断流走的感觉，因此‘想多待一会儿，心里发热，又因时间过去而发酸’说明了温暖与惆怅并存的原因，而不只是宣布情绪结果。解释没有编造人物前史或外部事件，也没有把听感比喻当作真实剧情。\",\"coverage_gaps\":[\"S02-B1：两条歌声贴近到呼吸、体温几乎化不开，以及夏末湿热微风般略带黏稠的肌肤感，尚未具体解释。\",\"S02-B2：持续如心跳、水浪的摇动，以及不再需要控制重力、放心交给船底承托的漂浮感，尚未解释；目前只承接了时间持续流逝的一面。\",\"S02-B5：感情在第12–14小节突然热切上涌，随后又轻轻呼气般退回柔和，短暂落稳后仍有一点漂浮、没有把心事说死的变化，尚未得到完整解释。\"]}", "metadata": {"session_handle": "84dc7bf7-3576-4166-b1c1-f373ba235428", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261025T045513834998Z", "elapsed_seconds": 44.641, "completed_utc": "2026-10-25T04:55:58.479821+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "5b0f089f16469c764137fa71a2e44a1483f494a240871cf22305c8f464ccfc9c", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683",